 "description": "Collection of Poems By Bewketu Seyoum ስብስብ ግጥሞች Collection of Poems brings together the powerful, witty, and deeply reflective voice of one of Ethiopia’s most celebrated contemporary writers. In this carefully curated volume, Bewketu Seyoum invites readers into a world where satire meets tenderness, and everyday life transforms into lyrical insight. Known for his sharp humor and fearless social commentary, Bewketu crafts poems that explore identity, love, time, injustice, memory, and the quiet contradictions of modern Ethiopian society. His language moves effortlessly between playful irony and emotional depth—making readers smile in one moment and pause in contemplation the next.",
